  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Development and Monitoring Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to address the chronic infrastructure gap in the Philippines by replenishing the Project Development and Monitoring Facility (PDMF), which will support public- private partnership (PPP) projects and enhance the management and operational capabilities of national government agencies, local government units (LGUs), and the PPP Center (PPPC) to effectively identify, develop, and manage PPP projects. The project will support the continuous promotion and operation of bankable, well-structured PPP projects at both the national and local government levels, ultimately leading to increased investment in infrastructure and helping to alleviate the financial burden on the Philippines.</narrative>
  </description>
